        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "db468a37-112a-5d98-a945-c3b1f215ae56",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Wenger, Victorinox\n- Products: Wenger Swiss Army knives, Victorinox collection, Delémont collection, Swiss Army knife, watches, licensed products\n- People: American soldiers\n- Concepts: Offiziersmesser, brand naming\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- After World War II, American soldiers coined the term \"Swiss Army knife\" because they had difficulty pronouncing \"Offiziersmesser,\" the German name.\n- Since 2013, Wenger Swiss Army knives have been integrated into the Victorinox collection as the \"Delémont collection.\"\n- Since 2013, the Wenger brand has remained in use for watches and licensed products.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
